<view class="reports-page"><view class="reports-heading"><view class="eyebrow">MY IMAGE REPORT</view><view class="title">每一次认识自己<text>
</text>都是更好的开始</view><view class="muted">你的形象分析档案，保存在这里</view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="card"><text>{{error}}</text><button bindtap="onShow">重试</button></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="notice">正在读取报告…</view><view wx:if="{{!loading && !error && !reports.length}}" class="card empty"><image class="empty-report" src="/assets/report-active.png"/><view class="section-title">还没有形象报告</view><view class="notice">完成一次检测体验，生成你的第一份报告</view><button class="primary" bindtap="start">开始检测体验</button><button class="link" bindtap="sample">先看看示例报告 →</button></view><view wx:for="{{reports}}" wx:key="id" class="saved-report card"><view class="row"><text class="demo-label">{{item.mode === 'ai' ? 'AI 分析报告' : '示例报告'}}</text><text class="muted">{{item.date}}</text></view><view class="saved-body" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><image src="/assets/face.jpg" mode="aspectFit"/><view><view class="section-title">个人形象风格分析报告</view><view class="muted">{{item.profile.gender}} · {{item.profile.age}}岁 · {{item.profile.height}}cm</view><view class="report-tags">形象DNA / 风格DNA / 色彩DNA</view></view><text class="arrow">›</text></view><view class="row report-actions"><button class="delete-link" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="remove">删除</button><button class="link" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open">查看完整报告 →</button></view></view><view wx:if="{{reports.length}}" class="new-report"><button class="primary" bindtap="start">＋ 新建检测报告</button></view><view class="storage-note">新生成的 AI 报告保存在账号中，示例报告和照片标注保存在本机。</view></view>
